{"lang":"kn","lot":2,"out":[{"pack":"humor","key":"break_ice","register":"neutral","fr":"Pour briser la glace, je vous offre un café ?","text":"ಮಾತು ಶುರು ಮಾಡಲು, ನಿಮಗೆ ಒಂದು ಕಾಫಿ ಕೊಡಿಸಲೇ?","back":"Pour commencer, puis-je vous offrir un café ?","err":null,"moteur":"mymemory"},{"pack":"humor","key":"just_kidding","register":"informal","fr":"Je plaisante, bien sûr !","text":"ತಮಾಷೆಗೆ ಹೇಳಿದೆ, ಖಂಡಿತ!","back":"Je plaisantais, bien sûr !","err":null,"moteur":"mymemory"},{"pack":"humor","key":"monday_irony","register":"ironic","fr":"Génial, on est lundi…","text":"ಅದ್ಭುತ, ಇವತ್ತು ಸೋಮವಾರ…","back":"Génial, aujourd'hui c'est lundi…","err":null,"moteur":"mymemory"},{"pack":"humor","key":"monday_irony","register":"neutral_meaning","fr":"Je n'aime pas les lundis.","text":"ನನಗೆ ಸೋಮವಾರ ಇಷ್ಟವಿಲ್ಲ.","back":"Je n'aime pas le lundi.","err":null,"moteur":"mymemory"}]}